TITLE:: SetupTestMidiOut
SUMMARY:: Stand-in MIDI port used while Setup is in test mode.
CATEGORIES:: Core
RELATED:: Classes/Setup, Classes/MIDIOut

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::SetupTestMidiOut:: is the object LINK::Classes/Setup#*midi:: returns while LINK::Classes/Setup#*testMode:: is CODE::true::. MIDI messages sent to it are ignored. The same instance is returned on every call.

LINK::#-next:: returns this object. LINK::Classes/Pbind:: sends CODE::next:: to each value, and an LINK::Classes/Event:: would be merged into the note instead of stored as the port.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: next
Returns this object, so a LINK::Classes/Pbind:: stores the port on the event.

ARGUMENT:: inval
The input event. It is ignored.

RETURNS::
This TELETYPE::SetupTestMidiOut::.

METHOD:: uid
A fixed device id for event code that reads CODE::midiout.uid::.

RETURNS::
The LINK::Classes/Integer:: 0.

PRIVATE:: doesNotUnderstand
